cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark harness or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Dual RTX 5060 Ti LLM Inference Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark harness and dataset for local LLM inference on an asymmetric
  consumer dual-GPU system (PCIe 5.0 x8 + chipset PCIe 4.0 x2), comparing
  single-GPU, layer-split and tensor-split configurations across llama.cpp
  and Ollama, with per-repetition telemetry (throughput, latency, PCIe
  traffic, energy).
type: software
authors:
